[ rauhut2024a_fig26: Theropod summary tree, read by eye. Fourteen clade names kept as internal labels: Tetanurae and Carnosauria (printed beside their nodes) and twelve box names, each box spanning one clade (Ceratosauria, Coelurosauria, Tyrannosauroidea, Megaraptora, Megalosauroidea, Piatnitzkysauridae, Megalosauridae, Spinosauridae, Allosauroidea, Metriacanthosauridae, Allosauridae, Carcharodontosauria). Polytomies: Australovenator-Megaraptor-Murusraptor, Metriacanthosaurus-Siamotyrannus-Sinraptor, and a four-way spinosaurid node (Irritator, Vallibonavenatrix and two pairs). 61 tips, 3 polytomies (3, 4, 3 children); 14 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

